The pattern followed here is:

4842 = 4 + 8 + 4 + 2 = 18;

5472 = 5 + 4 + 7 + 2 = 18;

2421 = 2 + 4 + 2 + 1 = 9;

7261 = 7 + 2 + 6 + 1 = 16;

Here the sum of digits of all numbers is multiple of 9 except option 4.

Hence, 7261 is the odd one among the given options.

